    "### Feed Forward Network (FFN)\n",
    "\n",
    "After attention, each token passes through a neural network:\n",
    "\n",
    "```text\n",
    "Linear → ReLU → Linear\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "This helps learn complex transformations."
