   "source": [
    "## Example Walkthrough\n",
    "\n",
    "Sentence:\n",
    "\n",
    "```text\n",
    "\"Machine learning is\"\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "### Tokenization\n",
    "\n",
    "```text\n",
    "[\"Machine\", \" learning\", \" is\"]\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "### Embedding\n",
    "\n",
    "Convert tokens into vectors.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Attention\n",
    "\n",
    "While predicting next word:\n",
    "\n",
    "The model examines:\n",
    "\n",
    "* Machine\n",
    "* learning\n",
    "* is\n",
    "\n",
    "and their relationships.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Prediction\n",
    "\n",
    "Possible outputs:\n",
    "\n",
    "| Word      | Probability |\n",
    "| --------- | ----------- |\n",
    "| powerful  | 0.40        |\n",
    "| useful    | 0.25        |\n",
    "| important | 0.20        |\n",
    "\n",
    "Suppose model selects:\n",
    "\n",
    "```text\n",
    "\"powerful\"\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "New sequence:\n",
    "\n",
    "```text\n",
    "\"Machine learning is powerful\"\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "Then prediction continues.\n",
    "\n",
    "## Pretraining\n",
    "\n",
    "GPT is pretrained on enormous datasets:\n",
    "\n",
    "Examples include:\n",
    "\n",
    "* books\n",
    "* articles\n",
    "* websites\n",
    "* code\n",
    "* conversations\n",
    "\n",
    "During pretraining:\n",
    "\n",
    "```text\n",
    "No labels needed\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "because predicting next token creates supervision automatically.\n",
    "\n",
    "## Fine-Tuning\n",
    "\n",
    "After pretraining, GPT can be adapted for tasks.\n",
    "\n",
    "Examples:\n",
    "\n",
    "| Task          | Example             |\n",
    "| ------------- | ------------------- |\n",
    "| Chatbots      | Conversations       |\n",
    "| Coding        | Code generation     |\n",
    "| Summarization | Short summaries     |\n",
    "| Translation   | Language conversion |\n",
    "| QA            | Answer questions    |\n",
    "\n",
    "## In-Context Learning\n",
    "\n",
    "A major GPT capability:\n",
    "\n",
    "### learning from prompts\n",
    "\n",
    "```text\n",
    "English: Hello\n",
    "French: Bonjour\n",
    "\n",
    "English: Thank you\n",
    "French:\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "GPT predicts:\n",
    "\n",
    "```text\n",
    "\"Merci\"\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "without retraining.\n",
    "\n",
    "## Charecterstics\n",
    "\n",
    "### GPT Generations\n",
    "\n",
    "| Model | Improvement                 |\n",
    "| ----- | --------------------------- |\n",
    "| GPT-1 | Initial decoder transformer |\n",
    "| GPT-2 | Strong text generation      |\n",
    "| GPT-3 | Massive scale               |\n",
    "| GPT-4 | Better reasoning/multimodal |\n",
    "\n",
    "#### Parameters\n",
    "\n",
    "Modern GPT models can contain:\n",
    "\n",
    "* billions\n",
    "* even trillions\n",
    "\n",
    "of parameters.\n",
    "\n",
    "#### Example Sizes\n",
    "\n",
    "| Model       | Parameters |\n",
    "| ----------- | ---------- |\n",
    "| GPT-2 Small | 117M       |\n",
    "| GPT-3       | 175B       |\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "#### Intuitive Analogy\n",
    "\n",
    "Imagine reading a story and continuously guessing the next word.\n",
    "\n",
    "Example:\n",
    "\n",
    "```text\n",
    "\"Once upon a ...\"\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "You naturally expect:\n",
    "\n",
    "```text\n",
    "\"time\"\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "GPT learns language in a similar way—but at massive scale.\n",
    "\n",
    "* a decoder-only Transformer\n",
    "* trained using next-token prediction\n",
    "* specialized for generation\n",
    "* capable of many language tasks\n",
    "\n",
    "### Strengths\n",
    "\n",
    "| Strength                | Explanation                    |\n",
    "| ----------------------- | ------------------------------ |\n",
    "| Natural text generation | Human-like writing             |\n",
    "| Few-shot learning       | Learns from examples           |\n",
    "| General-purpose         | Many tasks                     |\n",
    "| Scalable                | Performance improves with size |\n",
    "\n",
    "### Weaknesses\n",
    "\n",
    "| Weakness          | Reason                       |\n",
    "| ----------------- | ---------------------------- |\n",
    "| Hallucinations    | Generates plausible mistakes |\n",
    "| Expensive         | Huge compute cost            |\n",
    "| Bias              | Learns from internet data    |\n",
    "| Long context cost | Attention complexity         |\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "### GPT vs BERT\n",
    "\n",
    "| Feature      | GPT           | BERT          |\n",
    "| ------------ | ------------- | ------------- |\n",
    "| Architecture | Decoder       | Encoder       |\n",
    "| Direction    | Left-to-right | Bidirectional |\n",
    "| Main Task    | Generation    | Understanding |\n",
    "| Training     | Next token    | Masked words  |\n",
    "\n",
    "### Scaling Laws\n",
    "\n",
    "GPT models improve when increasing:\n",
    "\n",
    "* model size\n",
    "* dataset size\n",
    "* compute\n",
    "\n",
    "This is why larger GPT models are more capable.\n",
    "\n",
    "#### Why GPT Became So Powerful\n",
    "\n",
    "Key reasons:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. Transformer architecture\n",
    "2. Massive internet-scale pretraining\n",
    "3. Large parameter counts\n",
    "4. Self-attention\n",
    "5. In-context learning\n",
    "\n",
    "GPT models are among the most influential AI systems in modern deep learning."
